# TBCGuide - Draenei start: Ammen Vale and Azuremyst Isle (1-11)
# Copyright (C) 2026 GREYsaurus (https://github.com/GREYsaurus) - GPL-3.0-only. Original route and notes.

@guide A_Draenei_Azuremyst
@name Ammen Vale & Azuremyst Isle
@faction Alliance
@races Draenei
@levels 1-11
@zone Azuremyst Isle
@chapter Azeroth
@start
@desc Draenei starting route (TBC). The Exodar crash site in Ammen Vale to about 5, then Azure Watch, Odesyus' Landing, Stillpine Hold and the totem chain. Continues on Bloodmyst Isle.
@next A_Draenei_Bloodmyst

